        {
          "type": "intro",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-eyebrow"
              },
              "html": "Caresse vs Desire · 18+"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "A Desire alternative.<br><em>A couples game you listen to.</em>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Prefer a voice guiding your time together to sending dares on your phone? Caresse offers audio fiction for couples, without a score or cards to read during the session."
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "cta-group"
              },
              "html": "<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download for free</a>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-badge"
              },
              "html": "Guest mode · Free demos · iOS and Android<br>Paid personalised sessions, no subscription."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "In short"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Scored dares or a guided moment?"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "tldr-card"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Desire combines dares, quizzes, points and private couple chat. Caresse offers sessions narrated by a synthetic voice, solo or together. Both use AI: the useful distinction is how you spend the moment."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "verdict",
            "id": "verdict"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Comparison"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Caresse vs Desire"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "verdict-table-wrap",
                "tabindex": "0",
                "role": "region",
                "aria-label": "Caresse vs Desire"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "table",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "verdict-table"
                  },
                  "html": "<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Criterion</th><th scope=\"col\">Caresse</th><th scope=\"col\">Desire</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Format</th><td class=\"caresse\">Guided audio fiction</td><td class=\"other\">Dares, quizzes and missions</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Use</th><td class=\"caresse\">Solo or duo</td><td class=\"other\">Couple with an invited partner</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">During the moment</th><td class=\"caresse\">Listen, pause or stop</td><td class=\"other\">Send dares, answer, track points</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">AI</th><td class=\"caresse\">Audio session creation in the app</td><td class=\"other\">Desire AI for dares and suggestions</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">English audio</th><td class=\"caresse\">Available</td><td class=\"other\">Audio guidance not advertised in the sources checked</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Pricing</th><td class=\"caresse\">Free demos; credits, no subscription</td><td class=\"other\">Free download; purchases and optional Platinum</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Format’s focus</th><td class=\"caresse\">A narrated experience</td><td class=\"other\">A scored challenge game</td></tr>\n</tbody>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "cta-group",
                "style": "margin-top:32px"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "a",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US",
                    "class": "cta-pink",
                    "data-store-auto": "",
                    "data-cta-position": "inline",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "rel": "noopener"
                  },
                  "html": "Download for free"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Two formats"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "What do you want to do together?"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "columns-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "col-card highlight"
                  },
                  "html": "<p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p><h3>Audio at the centre of the moment.</h3><p>Caresse creates a guided audio fiction in the app from your preferences. A synthetic voice carries the narration; you remain free to pause, skip a suggestion or stop.</p><p>This website does not generate sessions. Demos are pre-generated examples; sessions created in the app are paid.</p><ul><li>A guided audio fiction, without reading cards during the session.</li><li>A solo or duo format, narrated by a synthetic voice.</li><li>Credits instead of a subscription.</li></ul>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "col-card muted"
                  },
                  "html": "<p class=\"col-sub\">Desire</p><h3>Dares and a score for your couple.</h3><p>Desire lets partners exchange dares and keep score. It can suit couples who prefer short prompts, quizzes and messages between them.</p><p>Desire also advertises AI that adapts suggestions to the couple. We do not claim AI personalisation is exclusive to Caresse.</p><ul><li>Exchange dares and earn points.</li><li>Answer quizzes and use private couple chat.</li><li>Use activity ideas from Desire AI.</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Pricing and access"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Compare the model, not just the download."
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "price-card highlight"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Caresse</h3><p class=\"price-big\">Credits, no subscription</p><p class=\"price-note\">Free download and demos. Creating a session in the app uses a paid credit.</p><p class=\"price-note\">An optional advanced-options unlock is sold separately; it does not include unlimited generation.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "price-card"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Desire</h3><p class=\"price-big\">Free + paid options</p><p class=\"price-note\">The App Store listing advertises in-app purchases and an optional auto-renewing Platinum subscription. Check the terms in your store.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-footnote"
              },
              "html": "Prices and offers vary by country and store. Check the terms shown before you buy. <a href=\"/en/pricing/\">Pricing Caresse</a>."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-footnote"
              },
              "html": "Published by Caresse using public publisher information checked on 10 October 2026. This is not an independent hands-on review. Sources: Official Desire website · Desire on the App Store · Desire on Google Play"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "By your preference"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Two ways to begin."
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "choose-card us"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3><ul><li>A guided audio fiction, without reading cards during the session.</li><li>A solo or duo format, narrated by a synthetic voice.</li><li>Credits instead of a subscription.</li></ul>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "choose-card them"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Choose Desire if you want…</h3><ul><li>Exchange dares and earn points.</li><li>Answer quizzes and use private couple chat.</li><li>Use activity ideas from Desire AI.</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Frequently asked questions"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Answers before you choose."
            },
            {
              "type": "faq",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-list"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "What is the difference between Caresse and Desire?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Desire is a couples game with scored dares, quizzes and chat. Caresse offers guided audio fiction with a synthetic voice, solo or together. It does not replace Desire’s score or chat."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Does Desire also use artificial intelligence?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Yes. Desire advertises AI for dares and suggestions. Caresse uses AI to create narrated sessions in the app; the audio format is the central distinction in this comparison."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Is there a Desire alternative without a subscription?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Caresse does not require a subscription: downloading and demos are free, while creating sessions uses paid credits. Desire offers an optional Platinum subscription alongside its free experience."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Do we need to read cards during a Caresse session?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. After setup and session creation in the app, a synthetic voice guides the fiction. You can pause, skip a suggestion or stop at any time."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Are Caresse’s personalised sessions free?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Downloading the app and listening to demos are free. Creating a session in the app uses a paid credit, with no subscription. The optional advanced-options unlock is separate."
